1
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:44,840
Mom, why are you leaving in such a hurry?

2
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:46,200
Why not stay a few more days?

3
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:48,000
Your dad is home alone.

4
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:49,520
You know how he is.

5
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:50,480
He definitely won't

6
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:52,440
eat properly without me.

7
00:00:55,960 --> 00:00:58,880
I'll definitely go back
to visit you next month.

8
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:03,680
Qingqing,

9
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:06,800
I need to apologize to you.

10
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:09,880
I got the wrong person before.

11
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,840
What are you talking about?

12
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,240
There's no need to apologize.

13
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:15,080
Don't worry.

14
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:16,200
We've already

15
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,840
handed it over to the police.

16
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,480
When you were little,

17
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:26,880
I just wanted you

18
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:29,640
to study hard and get good grades.

19
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:33,080
When you grew up, I wanted you

20
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:34,440
to work hard

21
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:36,200
and get a job at a big company.

22
00:01:36,600 --> 00:01:38,200
You didn't let us down.

23
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,479
You're my good daughter.

24
00:01:46,039 --> 00:01:46,880
It's just...

25
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:50,120
I feel like I'm not a good mother.

26
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,000
I always wanted

27
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:54,320
you to find a well-off man,

28
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:55,680
but I don't know

29
00:01:56,759 --> 00:01:58,280
if that's what you wanted.

30
00:01:58,880 --> 00:02:00,080
That's not true.

31
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:07,600
You're the best mom in the world.

32
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:12,400
I just want my daughter
to be happy forever.

33
00:02:12,760 --> 00:02:14,840
No matter what you do,

34
00:02:14,880 --> 00:02:17,480
your dad and I will always support you.

35
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,040
Don't cry.

36
00:02:23,079 --> 00:02:24,240
Don't cry.

37
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:29,440
Mom feels that Shen really likes you.

38
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:32,360
Mom and Dad just want you to find someone

39
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:35,000
who truly likes and cherishes you.

40
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:46,820
Look at you, crying like a little kitten.

41
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:47,850
Stop crying.

42
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:51,200
There, there. Don't cry.

43
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,120
Not sleeping in the middle of the night,

44
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:12,000
doing a puzzle all by yourself?

45
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,960
What a beautiful aurora.

46
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,200
A gift from Shen Feng?

47
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,820
Have you found the answer?

48
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,000
Maybe.

49
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:22,079
What do you mean, maybe?

50
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:23,120
Love is love.

51
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,240
If you don't love him, you don't.

52
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:26,100
There's no middle ground in love.

53
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:33,000
When I first met Zhang Yi,

54
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:35,720
from our ups and downs
to talking about marriage,

55
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:38,240
I thought I had love and happiness.

56
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:40,240
But in the end, I found out that

57
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,770
what I was holding tightly
wasn't chocolate,

58
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,480
but dog shit.

59
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:47,200
I did fall for Shen Feng,

60
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:51,800
but I'm not sure

61
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:53,840
if this relationship is chocolate.

62
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:55,300
You don't trust Shen Feng?

63
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:58,760
No, Shen Feng is great.

64
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:01,440
He's someone I can trust and rely on.

65
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:04,400
I just don't trust myself.

66
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:08,640
Do I still have the energy
to maintain a relationship?

67
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:10,160
Can I still love?

68
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:12,930
I'm afraid of disappointing Shen Feng

69
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:14,440
and myself.

70
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:16,079
Why would you think that?

71
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:18,040
You have to believe that you are the best.

72
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:19,360
Whoever is with you

73
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,560
will be happy.

74
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:23,120
Don't just blame yourself
when you run into problems.

75
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:25,380
Think more about other people's faults.

76
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:37,440
People get lost

77
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:40,240
because they think too much
and do too little.

78
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:42,120
Thinking only brings problems.

79
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:44,050
You only find the answers by doing.

80
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,000
Don't miss out

81
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,040
on an entire orchard

82
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,700
just because of one bad fruit.

83
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:53,400
You should ask it

84
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:55,240
if it really wants it.

85
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,730
Be more determined.

86
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:07,200
Shout out

87
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:08,400
what you really want!

88
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,400
I want Shen Feng.

89
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:16,160
His body, his soul,

90
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:18,640
I want everything about him.

91
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:23,240
I want it all.

92
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,640
You imitate that so well.

93
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:52,659
Brother, where did
these flowers come from?

94
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:53,890
They're beautiful.

95
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:56,960
Huohuo, do you like Qingqing?

96
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,080
How about I make Qingqing

97
00:05:58,080 --> 00:05:59,210
a part of our family?

98
00:05:59,440 --> 00:06:02,800
I do, but I'm still too young.

99
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,240
She'll have to wait for me.

100
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:07,080
I'll grow up fast and marry her.

101
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:09,600
In your dreams.

102
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,320
Look at you, getting all defensive.

103
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:13,840
I've always known you like Qingqing.

104
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,040
Go for it.

105
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,170
I'm rooting for you.

106
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:20,600
Qingqing,

107
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,040
Shen Feng,

108
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,240
I've decided on my wish.

109
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:25,440
What is it?

110
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,560
I want to see you

111
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:28,840
right now.

112
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:31,040
Wasn't that my wish before?

113
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:31,840
That's right,

114
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:35,159
but now it's mine.

115
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:37,840
I'll wait for you at the usual place.

116
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:39,640
Come on, brother!

117
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:58,840
Shen Feng,

118
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,760
I have something to tell you.

119
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,160
Me too.

120
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:09,320
You... I...

121
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,240
Let me go first.

122
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,240
Okay.

123
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:13,200
I know you're hesitating and struggling,

124
00:09:13,200 --> 00:09:13,960
but I really hope

125
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,620
you can give me another chance

126
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:16,960
to prove that

127
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:18,640
I love you.

128
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:23,960
You just said everything I wanted to say.

129
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,000
Take it back. Take it back.

130
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:25,640
You can

131
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:27,040
say it again.

132
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:29,440
But I only want to hear
the last three words.

133
00:09:31,640 --> 00:09:32,440
Three words?

134
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:35,520
Can you stop being so weird?

135
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:38,580
I'm literally dying of nervousness,
and you...

136
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:38,120
Hello.

137
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,840
Are you here to check in?

138
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:40,850
I'm the manager.

139
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:50,440
Qingqing.

140
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,680
Tangtang.

141
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:54,200
My Qingqing.

142
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:58,600
My financing completely failed.

143
00:10:58,600 --> 00:11:00,320
Wall Street doesn't appreciate me.

144
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:01,250
What should I do?

145
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:03,840
I'm going to be blacklisted.

146
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,440
Don't panic.

147
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:08,260
Come, sit down and tell me.

148
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:12,480
Business at Yunbianshang
has been great lately.

149
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,800
We held an event recently

150
00:11:13,800 --> 00:11:15,120
and attracted a lot of guests.

151
00:11:15,120 --> 00:11:16,600
They all gave us good reviews.

152
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:17,600
It won't be long

153
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,880
before we're out of debt

154
00:11:18,880 --> 00:11:20,010
and making a profit.

155
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:24,840
No, the B&B's profits are too unstable.

156
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:27,200
I'm tired. I'm exhausted.

157
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:29,760
I really can't hold on anymore.

158
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:31,760
I'm going to sell it right now.

159
00:11:33,560 --> 00:11:36,320
Maybe I can get some money
to pay off my debts.

160
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:40,200
Do you have to sell it?

161
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,860
Yes, I'm selling it right now.

162
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:45,320
Okay, then just sell it to me.

163
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,280
Stop joking.

164
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:52,160
What are you talking about?

165
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:54,290
Where would you get that kind of money?

166
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,600
The wedding fund I saved up.

167
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:58,040
I don't need it anymore.

168
00:11:58,200 --> 00:12:00,000
I might as well use it all.

169
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:01,120
If it's not enough,

170
00:12:01,280 --> 00:12:02,960
I'll figure out the rest.

171
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:07,360
I'll cover the rest.

172
00:12:09,880 --> 00:12:10,680
Hold on.

173
00:12:14,560 --> 00:12:15,520
Shen Feng,

174
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:17,450
the top student.

175
00:12:18,080 --> 00:12:18,520
No.

176
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:21,200
Y-You guys are...

177
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:22,360
Tang,

178
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:23,720
I'll tell you all the gossip

179
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:25,280
in detail later.

180
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:27,400
Shen Feng, don't do anything rash.

181
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:28,600
Who's being impulsive?

182
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:31,260
What? Am I supposed to
just watch you make money?

183
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:33,260
I've been jealous for a long time.

184
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:35,400
The previous collab between
Yunbianshang and the tea garden

185
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:36,280
was a huge success.

186
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:38,120
Everyone says we're a package deal.

187
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:40,000
Let's just take it over together.

188
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,800
You'll be the major shareholder,

189
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:43,930
and I'll be the second. How about that?

190
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:46,680
Really?

191
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:47,400
Of course.

192
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,600
Let's sign the contract right now.

193
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,200
Sign the contract right now.

194
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:25,050
When I first lost my job,

195
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,980
I thought about ending it all.

196
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:29,260
But Shen Feng was actually right.

197
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:31,760
What I wanted to end wasn't my life,

198
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:33,520
but the pain.

199
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:51,360
Smile, you two new bosses.

200
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:57,690
Change your pose. Let's take another one.

201
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,560
When I was at my lowest
and most frustrated,

202
00:14:02,560 --> 00:14:04,240
you reached out and held me.

203
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:05,920
You made me realize

204
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:08,680
that there's never just one way to live,

205
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:11,480
and certainly not just one answer to life.

206
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:14,080
Congratulations to me.

207
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:15,940
I not only found the life I wanted,

208
00:14:16,400 --> 00:14:19,520
but also the love I want to hold on to.

209
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:52,920
Actually, we don't need
to deliberately seek happiness.

210
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:55,720
As long as we avoid all pain

211
00:14:56,120 --> 00:14:57,640
within our ability,

212
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:01,120
and don't let ourselves
suffer even a little bit,

213
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:03,000
don't do things we don't like,

214
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:04,560
don't associate with people we don't like,

215
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:06,120
and don't listen to words we don't like,

216
00:15:06,120 --> 00:15:08,720
that is a kind of happiness.

217
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:43,480
The light came, and the rain came.

218
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:44,000
Pushing open the small door,

219
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:44,930
I saw a new world.

220
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,120
We live for 30,000 days,

221
00:15:49,280 --> 00:15:51,280
and every day passed is one day less.

222
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:53,360
Every tomorrow is a blind box.

223
00:15:54,760 --> 00:15:55,960
Who says

224
00:15:57,960 --> 00:15:59,820
today can't be a hidden surprise?

225
00:16:03,560 --> 00:16:05,640
Hello, I'd like to check in.

226
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:11,440
Hello, welcome.
